// The Old Rod, and Old Salt's lessons (quests/south/side.lute southOldSalt).

## The end of the pier

::bg{location="tidewell-pier" time="day"}
::auto{character="tidewellMorrow" anchor="center" action="enter"}
@tidewellMorrow: Sit down, sit down. You've the look of someone who's never held a rod. Everyone in Tidewell was fishing before they could walk. Some of us instead of walking.
@tidewellMorrow{emotion="laughing"}: Here. It's old, like me, and it bends, like me, and it's never once let go of a fish. Unlike me.
::give{item="oldRod"}
@narrator: {{userName}} received an Old Rod!
@tidewellMorrow: Lesson one: drop it off any pier and wait. Bring me a Goldfinn. Everyone laughs at Goldfinn. Bring me one anyway.
::accept{quest="southOldSalt"}
